          "id": "code-ml-04-2-ch04_2_diag",
          "title": "Audit Dimensi Tinggi: Batas VC Vacuous vs Rademacher Berbatas Norm",
          "language": "python",
          "filename": "04_2_vc_vs_rademacher_highdim.py",
          "code": "import numpy as np\n\n# Diagnostik Dimensi Tinggi: Mengapa Batas VC Menjadi Vacuous Sementara Rademacher Tetap Ketat\nn = 1000\ndelta = 0.05\nB = 3.0  # norm bobot terkendali oleh regularisasi L2 (||w||_2 <= 3)\n\nprint(f\"Perbandingan Batas Generalisasi pada n={n:,}, delta={delta}, ||w||_2 <= {B}\")\nprint(\"Skenario: Fitur sparse/terkompresi dengan energi total konstan ||x_i||_2 = 2.0\")\nprint(\"-\" * 78)\nprint(f\"{'Dimensi d':>10} | {'VC-Dim (d+1)':>12} | {'VC Penalty':>12} | {'Rademacher Penalty':>18} | {'Status VC':>14}\")\nprint(\"-\" * 78)\n\nx_norm_const = 2.0\nrad_term = 2.0 * (B * x_norm_const / np.sqrt(n)) + 3.0 * np.sqrt(np.log(2.0 / delta) / (2.0 * n))\n\nfor d in [10, 50, 200, 1000, 5000]:\n    d_vc = d + 1\n    # Lemma Sauer-Shelah berlaku saat n >= d_vc: ln Pi_H(2n) <= d_vc * ln(2*e*n/d_vc)\n    # Saat d_vc > n, fungsi mampu men-shatter semua n titik (Pi_H(2n) = 2^(2n)) -> vacuous total!\n    if d_vc <= n:\n        log_growth = d_vc * np.log(2.0 * np.e * n / d_vc)\n    else:\n        log_growth = 2.0 * n * np.log(2.0)\n    vc_pen = float(np.sqrt((8.0 * log_growth + 8.0 * np.log(4.0 / delta)) / n))\n    status = \"Informatif\" if vc_pen < 0.5 else (\"Longgar\" if vc_pen <= 1.0 else \"VACUOUS (>1.0)\")\n    print(f\"{d:>10d} | {d_vc:>12d} | {vc_pen:>12.4f} | {rad_term:>18.4f} | {status:>14}\")\n\nprint(\"-\" * 78)\nprint(\"Insight Principal Engineer: Regularisasi L2 mengunci kapasitas efektif di Rademacher\")\nprint(\"meski dimensi fitur ambien melonjak dari 10 hingga 5.000+ (seperti feature hashing/embeddings).\")",
          "expectedOutput": "Perbandingan Batas Generalisasi pada n=1,000, delta=0.05, ||w||_2 <= 3.0\nSkenario: Fitur sparse/terkompresi dengan energi total konstan ||x_i||_2 = 2.0\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n Dimensi d | VC-Dim (d+1) |   VC Penalty | Rademacher Penalty |      Status VC\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n        10 |           11 |       0.7622 |             0.5083 |        Longgar\n        50 |           51 |       1.3929 |             0.5083 | VACUOUS (>1.0)\n       200 |          201 |       2.3103 |             0.5083 | VACUOUS (>1.0)\n      1000 |         1001 |       3.3355 |             0.5083 | VACUOUS (>1.0)\n      5000 |         5001 |       3.3355 |             0.5083 | VACUOUS (>1.0)\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nInsight Principal Engineer: Regularisasi L2 mengunci kapasitas efektif di Rademacher\nmeski dimensi fitur ambien melonjak dari 10 hingga 5.000+ (seperti feature hashing/embeddings).",
